  "scenario": "two_tag",
  "$comment": "Hand-written (not recorded): every state of the host's tag attribution on bays whose readers several bays share - the openams_ui bay keys tg, tc, tr and to - with the edge cases a reader must survive. oams1: unknown, a candidate with a manual link, claimed_twice naming oams2's bay 2 (slot id 5), attributed and loaded. oams2: each other conflict reason, and claimed_twice back to slot id 2. oams3: ambiguous_pair, a reason this build does not know, claimed_twice naming a slot id no bay has, and claimed_twice without `to`. oams4: two candidates (one with neither material nor color, one with a material longer than the model keeps) and a third that is dropped, a candidate on an empty bay with an unreadable color, a letter this build does not know, and `tc`/`tr` sent where they do not belong. oams5: a unit that does not list rfid_scan, a candidate whose `tc` is not a list, a candidate linked from a tag, and a bay with no `tg` at all.",
